message: "If you use YAF in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "YAF: YuanXu Antenna Forge — AI-driven antenna inverse design platform"
type: software
authors:
  - name: "1ove9"
    email: 1ove9@users.noreply.github.com
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-05-21
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/1ove9/yaf-goai-semifinal"
keywords:
  - antenna design
  - inverse design
  - electromagnetics
  - FDTD
  - method of moments
  - deep learning
  - differentiable simulation
  - metasurface
  - topology optimization
abstract: >-
  YAF is an open-source platform for AI-driven antenna design: it combines
  differentiable FDTD (JAX), generative models (VAE/GAN/diffusion), neural
  operator surrogates (FNO/DeepONet), Bayesian and evolutionary optimization,
  and adapters to classical electromagnetic solvers (NEC2, openEMS) behind a
  single FastAPI + task-queue architecture.
